  "result": "Perfect! All 307 tests pass. The foreign currency functionality is now complete with 24 comprehensive tests:\n\n**Added to `src/money.js`:**\n- **`RATES`** object with exchange rates per euro:\n  - `EUR: 1` (baseline)\n  - `USD: 1.085` (1 EUR = 1.085 USD)\n  - `GBP: 0.8425` (1 EUR = 0.8425 GBP)\n\n- **`convert(cents, currency)`** function:\n  - Converts euros (in cents) to target currency (in cents of that currency)\n  - Returns `ok(converted_cents)` on success\n  - Returns `fail(UNKNOWN_CURRENCY)` for unsupported currencies\n  - Uses banker's rounding via roundCents for precision\n\n- **`formatMoney(cents, currency)`** function:\n  - Formats amounts with currency symbol:\n    - `$` for USD (e.g., \"$123.45\")\n    - `\u00a3` for GBP (e.g., \"\u00a3123.45\")\n    - `\u20ac` for EUR (e.g., \"\u20ac123.45\")\n  - Includes thousands separators\n  - Handles negative amounts with leading `-`\n  - Defaults to EUR for unknown currencies\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`:**\n- Added `UNKNOWN_CURRENCY` error code\n\n**Test coverage (24 new tests):**\n- RATES object has correct values\n- Converts EUR to USD correctly\n- Converts EUR to GBP correctly\n- Converts EUR to EUR (passthrough)\n- Rejects unknown currencies\n- Rounds conversion results to cents using banker's rounding\n- Handles large amounts\n- Handles small amounts (1 cent)\n- USD formatting with proper symbol\n- GBP formatting with proper symbol\n- EUR formatting with proper symbol\n- Thousands separators for all currencies\n- Negative amounts with sign prefix\n- Zero amounts\n- Small amounts with leading zero\n- Default behavior for unknown currencies\n- Precision tests for fractional conversions\n- Large six-digit amounts\n- Single digit amounts\n\nAll 307 tests pass (283 existing + 24 new currency tests).",
